Hello, world!\");`). Do not install packages, read arguments or change the filesystem. Leave unchanged: the original source, the oracle, the witness contract, the conformance and design documents, both test sources, test-execution-plan.json and any installed policy or schema assets.","reason":"The current testing Result establishes the defect. Direct CLI stdout was 'Hello world!\\n', not the required 'Hello, world!\\n', and both the component and UAT tests failed with that exact diff. The witness contract allows repair only of a materially established implementation defect, and only in generated/hello-world.mjs. The tests and plan match the oracle, so the defect is in the candidate, not in the verification assets. The construction author's own check does not count as acceptance.","supportRefs":["support://default-library-witness/complete-source-outcome@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/6e1e5c25637493ff15c7ae7dcf27dd42d3dbad4fbba72e0e488ae43a1ee014c7","result://abiogenesis/648bb54aa05d48f3d8ca77031c0bd3e2a9636725af681fd005f7e38dbedcb8b2"],"dependsOn":["graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/testing@5"]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/testing@5","contribution":"After the repair, run the same two declared commands again on the repaired bytes: `node generated/hello-world.mjs` and `node --test test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs`, both from cwd '.'. Record the actual status, stdout, stderr and pass/fail counts under execution-evidence, including any failure. The subject is the construction Result that repairs generated/hello-world.mjs.","reason":"The existing testing Result applies only to the supplied bytes. Once construction changes generated/hello-world.mjs, that Result no longer describes the current candidate. Assurance for the affected thread must be re-run so that UAT has current execution evidence: direct stdout/status, and at least 2 passes with 0 failures.","supportRefs":["support://default-library-witness/complete-source-outcome@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/6e1e5c25637493ff15c7ae7dcf27dd42d3dbad4fbba72e0e488ae43a1ee014c7","result://abiogenesis/648bb54aa05d48f3d8ca77031c0bd3e2a9636725af681fd005f7e38dbedcb8b2"],"dependsOn":["graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/construction@5"]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5","contribution":"Independently assess the full original outcome against source/basic-cli.oracle.json and the complete original source. The subject is the exact repaired candidate and the current post-repair testing Result: exact direct CLI stdout 'Hello, world!\\n' with status 0, and `node --test` with at least 2 passes and 0 failures, where both tests run the real CLI. Record any unmet or indeterminate criterion as such.","reason":"The oracle requires independent user-outcome assessment of current execution evidence, not of a report, file presence or stage count. The only execution Result so far shows unmet criteria on the unrepaired candidate. A meaningful acceptance verdict therefore needs the post-repair testing Result, which depends on both construction and re-testing.","supportRefs":["support://default-library-witness/complete-source-outcome@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/6e1e5c25637493ff15c7ae7dcf27dd42d3dbad4fbba72e0e488ae43a1ee014c7","result://abiogenesis/648bb54aa05d48f3d8ca77031c0bd3e2a9636725af681fd005f7e38dbedcb8b2"],"dependsOn":["graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/construction@5","graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/testing@5"]}],"gaps":[],"nextGraphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/construction@5","nextReason":"Actual execution has now established the defect. Direct stdout was 'Hello world!\\n', and `node --test` exi